"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[10620],{10620:function(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"content":"\\n<center>\\n<BookCard \\n          cover=\\"/assets/snippets/books/lesixieme-sommeil-2.png\\"\\n          title=\\"The Sixth Sleep 2\\"\\n          author=\\"Bernard Werber\\"\\n          publisher=\\"Open Books\\"\\n          publishedDate=\\"2024-07-25\\"\\n          isbn=\\"9788932924540\\"\\n          rating=3\\n          tags=\\"sf\\"\\n        />\\n</center>\\n\\n## Review\\nI am surprised by the freshness of the subject matter in Bernard\'s works, but left with disappointment at the too grandiose and forced conclusions.  \\n<mark>A giant imagination with an anticlimactic ending</mark>\\nCompared to the freshness of volume 1, the development of volume 2 leaves something to be desired.  \\nThe mystery and tension carefully built up were solved too easily with the appearance of a too convenient setup.  \\nThe narrative structure also repeats too much, which gives a sense of d\xe9j\xe0 vu.  "}')}}]);